Package: com.judahhuckaby.hammer
Name: Hammer
Version: 1.4
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Fast, reliable package manager for iOS 5 and 6
Hammer replaces Cydia on iOS 5 and 6 devices. It has its own modern HTTPS
(TLS 1.2/1.3), so current repositories load again, refreshes sources without
losing packages when one fails, hides packages made for other iOS versions,
repacks modern .debs so the old dpkg can install them, and rescues dead
repositories from SaurikIT's archives and the Internet Archive.
It uses the same package database as Cydia, so everything stays installed.
